  "notes": "VERB TYPE:\n{自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive verb)\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし})\n\nKANJI:\nCan be written as {彷徨|さまよ}う (literary).\n\n・さまよわない (negative)\n・さまよって (te-form)\n・さまよった (past)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{街|まち}をさまよう - to wander the streets\n・{夢|ゆめ}の{中|なか}をさまよう - to drift through dreams\n・{生死|せいし}の{境|さかい}をさまよう - to hover between life and death\n・{意識|いしき}がさまよう - one's consciousness drifts",
